&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A career driven by you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. We’re constantly innovating, evolving and transforming things for our customers. We’re driven, ambitious and determined to do our best work, together. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Team Lead Product Manager - Mobile Apps&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the vision, strategy, and execution of AutoScout24’s mobile app ecosystem across iOS and Android. You will lead a team of Product Managers, working closely with Engineering, Design, Data, Marketing, and Commercial stakeholders to deliver outstanding experiences that drive customer engagement, retention, and business growth.&lt;br&gt;You are both a strategic leader and a hands-on product expert who thrives in a fast-paced, data-driven environment. You will help shape the future of our mobile products while fostering a strong product culture and developing the next generation of product talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and communicate the mobile product vision, strategy, and roadmap aligned with company objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities through customer insights, market research, competitive analysis, and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive mobile-first thinking across the organization and advocate for exceptional user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear product goals, success metrics, and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a team of Product Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, experimentation, customer-centricity, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support career development, coaching, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective product management practices, frameworks, and ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering Managers, UX Designers, Data Analysts, and other stakeholders to deliver impactful solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize initiatives based on customer value, business impact, and technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution from discovery through delivery and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high-quality releases and continuous product improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Data Focus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand customer needs, behaviors, and pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use quantitative and qualitative insights to inform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive experimentation through A/B testing and iterative product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor product performance and continuously optimize key metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align cross-functional teams around product priorities and strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product strategy, roadmap, and outcomes to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence decision-making through strong business and customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of Product Management experience, including significant experience in mobile products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous leadership experience managing or mentoring Product Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering successful mobile app products at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in agile product development environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic thinking and product vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of mobile ecosystems, user behavior, and app growth strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills with experience using product analytics and experimentation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to balance customer and commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with engineering and design teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in marketplaces, e-commerce, automotive, or consumer digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of subscription, monetization, or growth product strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern product discovery methodologies and outcome-driven product management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture of growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Join us as a Product Manager – Web Platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;(all genders) in our Backoffice Platform&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight MacChromeBold SCXW92905516 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92905516 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and help shape the future of autonomous mobility!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At MOIA,&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;pioneering the future of autonomous mobility and AD fleet operations. Our mission is to make mobility safer and more accessible for everyone, and&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;already doing it at scale: Europe&#39;s biggest electric ride pooling fleet has carried over&amp;nbsp;9 million riders&amp;nbsp;to their destination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Want to come on board?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;Web&amp;nbsp;Platform team enables domain product&amp;nbsp;teams to build features across two applications: the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Backoffice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, our customer-facing&amp;nbsp;application&amp;nbsp;for B2B clients, and the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Admin Panel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, the internal frontend for managing customer and vehicle lifecycle operations across all B2B clients. The team owns the platform product strategy, shared foundations&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;including infrastructure, design system, authentication and authorization, and builds deployment automation on our own serverless AWS infrastructure, following the principle “you ship it, you own it.”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your job is to keep this a coherent platform, not a patchwork: build overarching functionality like user management once so domain teams ship and prototype faster, and compliance gets simpler for everyone. As a platform Product Manager, you&#39;re measured by the success of the teams you enable, not just your own.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join this cross-functional team of engineers, a designer, and an agilist. The Backoffice has evolved from an internal MOIA tool into a B2B platform used by cities and public transport operators across Europe. With this foundation in place, the team’s focus is now on scaling the platform through increased stability and domain team enablement. At the same time, the Admin Panel is becoming a critical part of the platform ecosystem. It gives internal teams such as GOES (Global Operator Enablement Services), B2B Support, and Product centralized visibility and control across the entire customer and vehicle lifecycle, helping them manage an increasingly complex partner landscape&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
