&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Black Forest Labs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re the team behind Latent Diffusion, Stable Diffusion, and FLUX—foundational technologies that changed how the world creates images and video. We’re creating the generative models that power how people make images and video—tools used by millions of creators, developers, and businesses worldwide. Our FLUX models are among the most advanced in the world, and we’re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Freiburg, Germany with a growing presence in San Francisco, we’re scaling fast while staying true to what makes us different: research excellence, open science, and building technology that expands human creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our models are seeing strong demand across startups, AI-native companies, and some of the world&#39;s most recognized brands. We need someone who can turn that demand into revenue — fast, consistently, and across a high volume of accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-cycle role: you own everything from first touch to close to renewal and upsell. Some of your accounts will be fast-moving AI startups. Others will be household-name enterprises starting with a focused use case — and it&#39;s your job to land them, prove value, and grow them into strategic relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re already closing deals and want to be at the forefront of the generative AI wave, this is the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle from qualification through close for SMB, startup, AI-native, and enterprise customers — including well-known global brands entering generative AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a book of 30-50+ accounts, driving retention, adoption, and expansion — turn initial use cases into broader adoption across teams, products, and business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify inbound leads and run outbound prospecting into target segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute sales campaigns in collaboration with sales leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle deals across API access and weight licensing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer needs and usage patterns into expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with solutions engineering and product on technical questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ve closed real deals, you move fast, and you&#39;re hungry to have outsized impact at a company where your work directly drives revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 years in a closing sales role, ideally with a BDR-to-AE progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling technical products — APIs, developer tools, cloud infrastructure, or AI/ML products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable discussing model capabilities, API integration, and deployment with technical buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of managing a high volume of accounts and deals in parallel without dropping balls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong outbound instincts — can build pipeline, not just work inbound&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a startup, scale-up, or high-growth environment where process didn&#39;t exist yet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized, disciplined, and self-directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: background in generative AI, image/video generation, or open-source business models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work Together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a distributed team with real offices that people actually use. Depending on your role, you’ll either join us in Freiburg or SF at least 2 days a week (or one full week every other week), or work remotely with a monthly in-person week to stay connected. We’ll cover reasonable travel costs to make this possible. We think in-person time matters, and we’ve structured things to make it accessible to all. We’ll discuss what this will look like for the role during our interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Everything we do is grounded in four values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obsessed.&lt;/strong&gt; We are a frontier research lab. The science has to be right, the understanding deep, the product beautiful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low Ego.&lt;/strong&gt; The work speaks. The best idea wins, no matter who said it. Credit is shared. Nobody is above any task.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bold.&lt;/strong&gt; We take the ambitious bet. We ship, we do not wait for conditions to be perfect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kind.&lt;/strong&gt; People over politics. We treat each other with genuine warmth. Agency without empathy creates chaos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like work you’d enjoy, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Annual Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;$130,000 - $180,000 + variable + equity&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EU&lt;/strong&gt; €90,000 - €145,000 + variable + equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead and develop a software engineering team of approximately 15 engineers building our Website Builder Application – driving roadmap delivery, technical excellence and team performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are accountable for the architectural direction, code quality, reliability and continuous evolution of the Website Builder Application in close collaboration with Product Management and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You educate, coach and grow your engineers, set clear goals and create an environment in which people do their best work and continuously develop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You drive our “AI first” initiative within your team and embed AI methods and tools deeply into daily engineering and product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You design and run continuous learning, training and enablement formats so every team member builds AI fluency and applies it confidently in their day-to-day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate closely with Product Management, Design, other engineering teams and stakeholders to shape priorities, unblock delivery and create business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a secondary responsibility, you act as the on-site representative for our Cologne development office and take care of selected operational and organizational topics around office, culture and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of experience leading software engineering teams of 15+ people, ideally in web applications, SaaS or website builder products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background in modern web technologies, distributed systems and agile delivery – credible and impactful with senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of shipping high-quality web or SaaS products at scale and continuously improving engineering practices, quality and velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI and GenAI tools and a clear vision for how AI changes engineering and product workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership skills: hiring, coaching, performance management and the ability to build a strong, inclusive team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mentality and ownership combined with the ability to balance technical depth with strategic thinking and clear prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong verbal and written German skills &lt;/strong&gt;(English is a big plus), and willingness to take on light operational site-representative duties for the Cologne office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
